master/servers/rendering/rendering_device_graph.cpp#L613), but I haven't tested it.\n\n---\n\nThe PR looks good to me. I don't see any issues from my review or testing. I figure any bugs, if any, will show up with more people testing the changes, so we should ideally get this merged in the early 4.7 development cycle.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114484#pullrequestreview-3716376988","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114484","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-01-28T12:09:25Z"},{"id":3749686291,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7ff6wT","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?u=2867ee7fcd920bc19b7d1cbf4b10264b9bbc9326&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","login":"bruvzg","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg"},"body":"I have not tested every rendering aspect, but so far did not encounter any regressions on macOS.\n\nRunning a simple project (`Truck Town` demo) on iOS (10.gen iPad)seems to result in the black screen and endless spam of, it's working fine with the current `master`:\n```\nservers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:5335:draw_list_draw(): No render pipeline was set before attempting to draw. Condition \"!draw_list.validation.pipeline_active\" is true.\nservers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:5031:draw_list_bind_render_pipeline(): Parameter \"pipeline\" is null. Parameter \"pipeline\" is null.\nservers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:5318:draw_list_set_push_constant(): This render pipeline requires (0) bytes of push constant data, supplied: (32) Condition \"p_data_size != draw_list.validation.pipeline_push_constant_size\" is true.\n```","html_url":"https://gi